# History of one file at a pinned commit, no clone.
Output docs/assets/demos/log.mp4
Output docs/assets/demos/log.gif
Set Height 340
Source demos/_setup.tape

Type "gion log chromium/chromium abc2bc3fe6dd --path README.md -n 5 --oneline"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Wait
Sleep 1500ms
Type "ls -A"
Enter
Sleep 2s
